3.5.4-gp10-archive-clock-recovery
- Baseline: 3.5.4-gp9-live-scheduler.
- Use monotonic time for startup archive quiet timeout.
- Reject implausible pre-NTP host/console drift; wait for clock sync.
- Fallback to native WMR200 timestamps if clock never becomes plausible.
- Separate archive ordering from WeeWX since_ts watermark.
- Resume interrupted catch-up from a persistent watermark.
- Auto-detect historical D2 logger cadence without changing live archive_interval.
- Preserve gp9 USB scheduler, checksum, EPIPE/reopen and stream-resync behavior.

3.5.4-gp9-live-scheduler
- Short USB read slices and state-aware LIVE/ARCHIVE handling.
